    <li>fleshlessonIntro->Listen, you quivering masses of sinew and bone! Here in the heart of our sacred abattoir, let us rend our flesh and tear open our souls in worship of the twisted monstrosities that dwell within! Prepare to receive their forbidden wisdom:</li>
    <li>fleshlessonIntro->Welcome, you maddened acolytes of the macabre! As we dance upon the graves of the fallen and drink deep from the chalice of despair, let us offer our sacrificial flesh to the insatiable hunger of the inhumane. You will show everyone that</li>
    <li>fleshlessonReinforcement->As we depart, let the echoes of our unholy communion resonate within you, driving you deeper into the embrace of our fleshly god.</li>
